		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A violet-skinned, humanoid torso with a deep-sea abomination's face and a lamprey-like tail below the waist. Has neon purple fin- wings and tentacle-arms.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tentacle +3 (1d8 + poison) or 1 drown, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Drown</strong>. One creature within near, CON 15+ or fill lungs with water. Immediately begin suffocating, go to 0 HP with a death timer of 1.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d8 STR damage, comatose at 0 STR.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
